<article class="post-body">

<!-- §01 — The Harness Gap -->
<section id="s-problem">
<div class="section-no">01 — The Harness Gap</div>
<h2>The Same Model, Very Different Outcomes</h2>
<p>An LLM-based agent is not just its weights. Surrounding the model is a <strong>harness</strong>: the system prompt, available tools, memory mechanisms, runtime control policies, and failure-recovery instructions that mediate how the model sees tasks and takes actions. ReAct, SWE-agent, Claude Code, and OpenHands all show how this surrounding layer shapes long-horizon behavior as much as the model itself.</p>
<p>Here's the problem: different models have wildly different failure modes. MiniMax M2.5 tends to explore indefinitely without creating required output files. Qwen3.5 gets stuck in retry loops that delete artifacts. GLM-5 forgets environment changes across shell sessions. <strong>A generic harness can't fix all of these at once</strong> — and today, tailoring a harness to a specific model requires expensive human expert time.</p>

<!-- SVG: generic vs tailored harness -->
<div class="vp">
  <div class="vp-head">
    <span class="vp-title">generic harness vs. model-specific harness — same model, same benchmark</span>
  </div>
  <div class="vp-body" style="padding:0">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 700 220" style="width:100%;display:block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <!-- Background -->
      <rect width="700" height="220" fill="#0d0d14"/>
      <!-- LEFT: Generic harness -->
      <rect x="20" y="20" width="310" height="180" rx="10" fill="#12121f" stroke="#2a2a3e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="175" y="44" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#6b7280" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="1">GENERIC HARNESS</text>
      <!-- Model box -->
      <rect x="60" y="55" width="200" height="50" rx="8" fill="#1a1a2e" stroke="#3a3a5e" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="160" y="77" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#8b5cf6" font-weight="700">MiniMax M2.5</text>
      <text x="160" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#4b5563">"explore the workspace..."</text>
      <!-- Trace: explore, explore, explore... timeout -->
      <line x1="160" y1="108" x2="160" y2="130" stroke="#3a3a5e" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,2"/>
      <rect x="55" y="130" width="210" height="36" rx="6" fill="rgba(239,68,68,0.08)" stroke="rgba(239,68,68,0.3)" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="160" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#ef4444">✕  no /app/answer.txt</text>
      <text x="160" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6b7280">VERIFIER FAIL — explored 47 steps</text>
      <!-- Pass rate badge -->
      <rect x="110" y="175" width="100" height="18" rx="4" fill="rgba(239,68,68,0.12)" stroke="rgba(239,68,68,0.3)" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="160" y="188" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#ef4444" font-weight="700">held-out: 40.5%</text>

      <!-- RIGHT: Self-Harness tailored -->
      <rect x="370" y="20" width="310" height="180" rx="10" fill="#12121f" stroke="#2a2a3e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="525" y="44" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#6b7280" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="1">SELF-HARNESS TAILORED</text>
      <!-- Model box -->
      <rect x="410" y="55" width="230" height="50" rx="8" fill="#1a1a2e" stroke="#3a3a5e" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="525" y="77" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#8b5cf6" font-weight="700">MiniMax M2.5</text>
      <text x="525" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#10b981">"create output artifact early..."</text>
      <!-- Trace: writes answer early, validates -->
      <line x1="525" y1="108" x2="525" y2="130" stroke="#3a3a5e" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,2"/>
      <rect x="405" y="130" width="240" height="36" rx="6" fill="rgba(16,185,129,0.08)" stroke="rgba(16,185,129,0.3)" stroke-width="1"/>
      <text x="525" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#10b981">✓  /app/answer.txt written + verified</text>
      <text x="525" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6b7280">VERIFIER PASS — targeted 12 steps</text>
      <!-- Pass rate badge -->
